    (ProgressStyle.setProgressTrackerIcon).

    Deliberately a single solid silhouette with no cutouts or interior detail:
    the tracker renders at roughly 16dp inside the bar, where the launcher mark
    turns to mush. A plain note reads instantly at that size.
-->
